{"logId": "7c574ad6-4191-4ebe-a5de-d92ab577e94a", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [166, 140, 554, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[166.0, 140.0], [554.0, 140.0], [554.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "一级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）", "block_bbox": [163, 215, 750, 240], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[163.0, 215.0], [750.0, 215.0], [750.0, 240.0], [163.0, 240.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：不因父母问题造成长期的精神困扰或有解决不了的家庭矛盾，这是家庭相处的底线原则。无论存在什么样的问题，都要积极地往好的方向上引导，至少不造成长期的“心病”，不造成精神压力和生活困扰。", "block_bbox": [164, 262, 1013, 347], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[164.0, 262.0], [1013.0, 262.0], [1013.0, 347.0], [164.0, 347.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [165, 390, 283, 413], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 390.0], [282.0, 390.0], [282.0, 412.0], [165.0, 412.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、根据个人/家庭收入情况和父母经济情况，合理给予双方父母收入的10%以内生活上的照顾（经济照顾的原则是量力而行，如果是新员工刚入职或没有经济基础时，优先安排好的首先是自己，可以不给或少给，随着收入的增加或不同级别的收入情况，合理地给予。一方面保障父母生活，一方面也不能超过收入的10%，保障自己提升品位和享受生活。）", "block_bbox": [181, 430, 1013, 545], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[181.0, 430.0], [1013.0, 430.0], [1013.0, 545.0], [181.0, 545.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不背负父母的责任和压力，要明白首先让自己轻松幸福，才能真正带动父母也幸福", "block_bbox": [180, 552, 862, 576], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[180.0, 552.0], [862.0, 552.0], [862.0, 576.0], [180.0, 576.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "[54]", "block_bbox": [573, 717, 611, 738], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）", "block_bbox": [207, 900, 595, 932], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[207.0, 900.0], [595.0, 900.0], [595.0, 932.0], [207.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "- 不符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 976, 337, 999], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 976.0], [336.0, 976.0], [336.0, 998.0], [202.0, 998.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、总觉得父母还没有享乐，自己享受生活就亏欠他们", "block_bbox": [218, 1016, 649, 1039], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1016.0], [649.0, 1016.0], [649.0, 1039.0], [218.0, 1039.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、因彼此观念不同，未顺从父母意愿而背负内心的压力和愧疚", "block_bbox": [218, 1047, 720, 1069], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1047.0], [720.0, 1047.0], [720.0, 1069.0], [218.0, 1069.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、盲目顺从父母，为了父母意图影响自我选择和规划，造成人生的痛苦，如学业、婚姻、孩子等", "block_bbox": [218, 1077, 988, 1100], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1077.0], [988.0, 1077.0], [988.0, 1100.0], [218.0, 1100.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不尊重父母意愿，强行改变父母喜欢的生活方式", "block_bbox": [218, 1108, 633, 1130], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1108.0], [633.0, 1108.0], [633.0, 1130.0], [218.0, 1130.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、父母离异，认为是其中一方过错而内心不接受、不原谅、无法释怀", "block_bbox": [219, 1138, 774, 1161], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1138.0], [774.0, 1138.0], [774.0, 1161.0], [219.0, 1161.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（父母有父母的生活和他们的选择，不合适的感情，放手也是最好的尊重和更多的自由。作为子女，应该用理性的眼光和释怀的态度对待，也站在客观和人性的基础上，引导父母更好地生活，让他们都保持乐观和阳光的状态。）", "block_bbox": [218, 1169, 1051, 1252], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1169.0], [1051.0, 1169.0], [1051.0, 1252.0], [218.0, 1252.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、没有个人独立的经济能力，需要父母持续性地给予帮助，“啃老族”的状态", "block_bbox": [219, 1260, 846, 1283], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1260.0], [846.0, 1260.0], [846.0, 1283.0], [219.0, 1283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、过度依附于父母，事事让父母替自己做决定，“妈宝男/女”的状态", "block_bbox": [219, 1291, 782, 1314], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1291.0], [782.0, 1291.0], [782.0, 1314.0], [219.0, 1314.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[55]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "block_id": 17, "block_order": null, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8134663105010986, "coordinate": [166, 140, 554, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[166.0, 140.0], [554.0, 140.0], [554.0, 172.0], [166.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.5719693899154663, "coordinate": [163, 215, 750, 240], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[163.0, 215.0], [750.0, 215.0], [750.0, 240.0], [163.0, 240.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.931995689868927, "coordinate": [164, 262, 1013, 347], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[164.0, 262.0], [1013.0, 262.0], [1013.0, 347.0], [164.0, 347.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6708338260650635, "coordinate": [165, 390, 283, 413], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 390.0], [282.0, 390.0], [282.0, 412.0], [165.0, 412.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9022303223609924, "coordinate": [181, 430, 1013, 545], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[181.0, 430.0], [1013.0, 430.0], [1013.0, 545.0], [181.0, 545.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8163905739784241, "coordinate": [180, 552, 862, 576], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[180.0, 552.0], [862.0, 552.0], [862.0, 576.0], [180.0, 576.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6908493638038635, "coordinate": [573, 717, 611, 738], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[573.0, 717.0], [610.0, 717.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.7750743627548218, "coordinate": [207, 900, 595, 932], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[207.0, 900.0], [595.0, 900.0], [595.0, 932.0], [207.0, 932.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6544343829154968, "coordinate": [202, 976, 337, 999], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[202.0, 976.0], [336.0, 976.0], [336.0, 998.0], [202.0, 998.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.816245436668396, "coordinate": [218, 1016, 649, 1039], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1016.0], [649.0, 1016.0], [649.0, 1039.0], [218.0, 1039.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7876179218292236, "coordinate": [218, 1047, 720, 1069], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1047.0], [720.0, 1047.0], [720.0, 1069.0], [218.0, 1069.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7829818725585938, "coordinate": [218, 1077, 988, 1100], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1077.0], [988.0, 1077.0], [988.0, 1100.0], [218.0, 1100.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7902204394340515, "coordinate": [218, 1108, 633, 1130], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1108.0], [633.0, 1108.0], [633.0, 1130.0], [218.0, 1130.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8215487003326416, "coordinate": [219, 1138, 774, 1161], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1138.0], [774.0, 1138.0], [774.0, 1161.0], [219.0, 1161.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9182348847389221, "coordinate": [218, 1169, 1051, 1252], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1169.0], [1051.0, 1169.0], [1051.0, 1252.0], [218.0, 1252.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8197374939918518, "coordinate": [219, 1260, 846, 1283], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1260.0], [846.0, 1260.0], [846.0, 1283.0], [219.0, 1283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8017510175704956, "coordinate": [219, 1291, 782, 1314], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1291.0], [782.0, 1291.0], [782.0, 1314.0], [219.0, 1314.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7105177640914917, "coordinate": [611, 1477, 650, 1498], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1477.0], [649.0, 1497.0], [611.0, 1497.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n一级【0~1分】：不因父母问题造成精神包袱和家庭矛盾。（底线原则）\n\n- 本条释义：不因父母问题造成长期的精神困扰或有解决不了的家庭矛盾，这是家庭相处的底线原则。无论存在什么样的问题，都要积极地往好的方向上引导，至少不造成长期的“心病”，不造成精神压力和生活困扰。\n\n## 符合的行为：\n\n1、根据个人/家庭收入情况和父母经济情况，合理给予双方父母收入的10%以内生活上的照顾（经济照顾的原则是量力而行，如果是新员工刚入职或没有经济基础时，优先安排好的首先是自己，可以不给或少给，随着收入的增加或不同级别的收入情况，合理地给予。一方面保障父母生活，一方面也不能超过收入的10%，保障自己提升品位和享受生活。）\n\n2、不背负父母的责任和压力，要明白首先让自己轻松幸福，才能真正带动父母也幸福\n\n[54]\n\n## 考评奖励标准——家庭（父母）\n\n## - 不符合的行为：\n\n1、总觉得父母还没有享乐，自己享受生活就亏欠他们\n\n2、因彼此观念不同，未顺从父母意愿而背负内心的压力和愧疚\n\n3、盲目顺从父母，为了父母意图影响自我选择和规划，造成人生的痛苦，如学业、婚姻、孩子等\n\n4、不尊重父母意愿，强行改变父母喜欢的生活方式\n\n5、父母离异，认为是其中一方过错而内心不接受、不原谅、无法释怀\n\n（父母有父母的生活和他们的选择，不合适的感情，放手也是最好的尊重和更多的自由。作为子女，应该用理性的眼光和释怀的态度对待，也站在客观和人性的基础上，引导父母更好地生活，让他们都保持乐观和阳光的状态。）\n\n6、没有个人独立的经济能力，需要父母持续性地给予帮助，“啃老族”的状态\n\n7、过度依附于父母，事事让父母替自己做决定，“妈宝男/女”的状态", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7c574ad6-4191-4ebe-a5de-d92ab577e94a/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F2240373a81862a6149c2751382020b7dd8422e434c2b4b385051ad29feb5a878"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7c574ad6-4191-4ebe-a5de-d92ab577e94a/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2Fdf795fe0ed5692d9c465bcbc8741924a64609b39191e4d6e24a9ed3ac3c8af02"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//7c574ad6-4191-4ebe-a5de-d92ab577e94a/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A14%3A34Z%2F-1%2F%2F3828ee90ad28ce98216844f5366fddb2b2805b95850c7c845c4a71ebdd8a7bad"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
